# darash — site shell authored in crepuscularity (.crepus)
# Rendered statically by `crepus render` (see site-src/build.ts); the console
# and live islands are Svelte components mounted onto [data-island] slots.
# Styling is UnoCSS utilities inline; styles.css only carries the base layer.

header class="sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/88 backdrop-blur-md"
  div class="max-w-[76rem] mx-auto px-5 flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 h-[52px]"
    a class="brand hidden sm:inline-flex items-baseline font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[15px] opacity-0 -translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300" href="#top" title="darash — all-in-one research crate"
      "darash"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "_"
    nav class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-x-2.5 sm:gap-x-[18px] flex-nowrap overflow-x-auto max-w-full [scrollbar-width:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="#install"
        "install"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="#search"
        "search"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="#fetch"
        "fetch"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="#api"
        "api"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="#live"
        "live"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] whitespace-nowrap hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="https://github.com/tschk/darash"
        "github"

main class="max-w-[76rem] mx-auto px-5"

  section class="pt-[72px] pb-12 flex flex-col gap-3.5" id="hero"
    h1 class="m-0 text-[clamp(44px,8vw,76px)] leading-none tracking-[-0.04em] font-bold"
      "darash"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "_"
    p class="m-0 text-zinc-400 text-[17px] max-w-[46rem]"
      "The all-in-one research crate — search + fetch + extract, key-free and deterministic."
    p class="m-0 text-zinc-400 text-[13px]"
      "Hebrew "
      span class="text-blue-500 text-[15px]"
        "דָּרַשׁ"
      " (darash) — “to seek, to inquire, to search out.”"
    p class="m-0 text-zinc-100 text-[13px]"
      "$ cargo add darash"
      span class="text-zinc-500"
        "  # async search · page fetch · HTML extraction — one dependency, no API keys"
    div data-island="console"
      p class="text-zinc-400"
        "loading console…"
    div class="flex gap-4 flex-wrap mt-1"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-2.5 py-[5px] hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="https://crates.io/crates/darash"
        "crates.io/crates/darash"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-2.5 py-[5px] hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="https://github.com/tschk/darash"
        "github.com/tschk/darash"
      a class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-2.5 py-[5px] hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors" href="https://docs.rs/darash"
        "docs.rs/darash"

  section class="py-[34px] md:py-11" id="install"
    h2 class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-[21px] tracking-[-0.01em] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "$"
      " install"
    p class="m-0 mb-3.5 text-zinc-400 max-w-[58rem]"
      "One dependency for the whole research loop. The "
      code
        "darash"
      " binary ships with the crate."
    div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
      span class="block px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-dashed border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"
        "shell"
      pre class="m-0 px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] overflow-x-auto"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# add the crate"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "cargo add darash"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# or install the research binary"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "cargo install darash"
    div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
      span class="block px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-dashed border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"
        "src/main.rs"
      pre class="m-0 px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] overflow-x-auto"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "use darash::@LB@fetch, SearchClient, SearchRequest@RB@;"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "#[tokio::main]"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "async fn main() -> Result<(), darash::Error> @LB@"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    let request = SearchRequest::new(\"rust async\");"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    let response = SearchClient::local()?.search_request(&request).await?;"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    for source in response.cited_sources() @LB@"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "        println!(\"@LB@@RB@: @LB@@RB@\", source.title, source.url);"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    @RB@"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    let report = fetch::fetch(\"https://example.com\", &[]).await?;"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    println!(\"@LB@@RB@\", report.summary());"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    Ok(())"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "@RB@"

  section class="py-[34px] md:py-11" id="search"
    h2 class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-[21px] tracking-[-0.01em] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "$"
      " darash search"
    p class="m-0 mb-3.5 text-zinc-400 max-w-[58rem]"
      "Provider-neutral async search. "
      code
        "SearchClient::local()"
      " runs the in-process multi-source backend; "
      code
        "SearchClient::new(endpoint)"
      " targets any SearxNG-compatible endpoint. No AI provider is called — results project into citations for the host to synthesize."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " modes"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "speed"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Selects one provider and returns at most 5 results."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "balanced (default)"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Selects up to two providers and returns at most 10 results."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "quality"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Selects all requested providers and returns at most 20 results."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " sources"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "web (default)"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Queries the hosted metasearch backend; plug in any SearxNG/websurfx instance."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "academic"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Queries OpenAlex works."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "discussions"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Queries Hacker News Algolia results."
    p class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] max-w-[58rem]"
      "Each selected provider contributes up to 5 results in "
      code
        "speed"
      " and up to 10 in "
      code
        "balanced"
      " or "
      code
        "quality"
      ", before URL deduplication and relevance ranking. Every SearchResult carries its title, URL, content, engines, category, publication date, and score."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " cli"
    div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
      span class="block px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-dashed border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"
        "shell"
      pre class="m-0 px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] overflow-x-auto"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# in-process backend, cited sources"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash search"
          " \"rust async\""
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# pick a mode and a source"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash search"
          " \"rust async\" --mode quality --source academic"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# point at another SearxNG-compatible endpoint"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash search"
          " \"rust async\" --url http://localhost:8080"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# machine-readable results"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash search"
          " \"rust async\" --mode speed --json"

  section class="py-[34px] md:py-11" id="fetch"
    h2 class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-[21px] tracking-[-0.01em] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "$"
      " darash fetch"
    p class="m-0 mb-3.5 text-zinc-400 max-w-[58rem]"
      "Every fetch returns a FetchReport with the status, final URL, redirect flag, elapsed time, content type, size, and body — never silent, even for error statuses. Bodies are capped at 2 MiB. Extraction is local and deterministic."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " extraction"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "(default)"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Full report as JSON, including the body."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--body"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Print only the response body."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--md"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Render the page as markdown."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--text"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Render the page as plain text."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--outline"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Show repeating structures found on the page."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--select CSS"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Print text matches for a CSS selector."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--count"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "With --select, print just the match count."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--row \"name=sel,url=a@href\""
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Extract multi-field rows from a repeating container named by --select."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--table"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Extract keyed table rows."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--locate TEXT"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Find the deepest element whose text or attribute contains TEXT; prints a CSS selector path and an 80-character snippet."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " pagination, filtering, output"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--limit N"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Caps a page of structured output. Default 50."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--offset N"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Starts the page at N (structured output only)."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--where EXPR"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Filter --row / --table output with a safe expression language: == != ~ !~ > >= < <=, && / || / !, /regex/[flags], and backtick column names."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--budget N"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Cut output at item boundaries to an estimated token budget (≈4 chars/token), always keeping at least one item."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--json"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Wrap any mode as a data + meta envelope (status, ok, url, ms, bytes, count, omitted)."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--json-envelope"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Structured output as a paginated envelope (state, total, offset, returned, next_offset), where state is more, complete, or past_end."
    p class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] max-w-[58rem]"
      "Rows and a single table print as TSV by default; --json switches them to JSON rows, and multiple tables always print as JSON. Omissions and pagination are announced on stderr, never silent."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " curl reflexes"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-X, --method M"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Request method."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-d, --data BODY|@FILE|@-"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Request body; @file and @- strip CR/LF."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--data-raw B"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Body where @ is never read as a file."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--data-binary B"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Body kept byte for byte."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-u USER:PASS"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Basic auth."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-I, --head"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "HEAD request."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-o FILE"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Atomic write to a file (default report or --body)."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-k, --insecure"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Accept invalid TLS certificates."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-m, --max-time SECS"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Request timeout in seconds."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--max-bytes N"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Override the 2 MiB fetch body cap."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--header 'Name: value'"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Add a request header."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-f, --fail"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "HTTP error exits 22 after printing the report."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "-L, -i, -s, -S"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Accepted no-ops, for curl muscle memory."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " cache"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "(default)"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Fetched URL bodies are cached ~2 minutes under the user cache dir and reused by parse modes. Cache hits announce their age on stderr."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--fresh"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Refetch and re-cache, ignoring any cached body."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "--no-cache"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Never read from or write to the cache."
    p class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] max-w-[58rem]"
      "The cache is bypassed by custom headers, non-GET methods, request bodies, Cache-Control: no-store, and credential-bearing URLs."
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " cli"
    div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
      span class="block px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-dashed border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"
        "shell"
      pre class="m-0 px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] overflow-x-auto"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# full report, JSON (default)"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# markdown within ~800 tokens"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com --md --budget 800"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# discover structure, then extract rows"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com --outline"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com --select \".item\" --row \"title=h2, url=a@href\""
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# filter rows, page them, wrap in an envelope"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com --select \".item\" --row \"title=h2, url=a@href\" \\"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    --where 'title ~ /rust/' --limit 10 --offset 20 --json-envelope"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# which selector holds this text?"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com --locate \"Example Domain\""
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# curl reflexes + local files work too"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " https://example.com -X POST -d @payload.json --header 'Content-Type: application/json'"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "darash fetch"
          " page.html --md --fresh"
    p class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] max-w-[58rem]"
      "Limits: 15 s search timeout, 256 KiB search response cap, 2 MiB fetch body cap, queries ≤ 512 chars, http/https only, no embedded credentials."

  section class="py-[34px] md:py-11" id="api"
    h2 class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-[21px] tracking-[-0.01em] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "$"
      " hosted api"
    p class="m-0 mb-3.5 text-zinc-400 max-w-[58rem]"
      "A hosted instance at "
      code
        "https://darash.tsc.hk"
      " exposes the same search + fetch loop over HTTP — same-origin, JSON in, JSON out. The live panel at the bottom of this page is the hosted API talking about itself."
    div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
      span class="block px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-dashed border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"
        "endpoints"
      pre class="m-0 px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] overflow-x-auto"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/health"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/search?q=&mode=speed|balanced|quality&limit="
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/fetch?url=&md=1&text=1&outline=1&select=&limit=&budget="
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "POST /api/batch              "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# free key — concurrent fetch, cap 20 (pro 45)"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "POST /api/async/jobs         "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# free key — background job, poll the result"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/async/jobs/<id>    "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# job status + results"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "POST /api/research           "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# pro — search + fetch a source corpus"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/account            "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# your usage — requires a key"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/stats              "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# public totals"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "GET  /api/live               "
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# public websocket event stream"
    div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-lg bg-zinc-950 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
      span class="block px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-dashed border-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]"
        "curl"
      pre class="m-0 px-3.5 py-3 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.7] overflow-x-auto"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# liveness"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "curl"
          " https://darash.tsc.hk/api/health"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# search, quality mode, 10 results"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "curl"
          " \"https://darash.tsc.hk/api/search?q=rust+async&mode=quality&limit=10\""
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# fetch as markdown"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "curl"
          " \"https://darash.tsc.hk/api/fetch?url=https://example.com&md=1\""
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# batch fetch with a free key"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "curl"
          " -X POST https://darash.tsc.hk/api/batch \\"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    -H \"authorization: Bearer dk_…\" -H 'content-type: application/json' \\"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    -d '@LB@\"urls\": [\"https://example.com\"]@RB@'"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          " "
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          span class="text-zinc-600"
            "# research corpus (pro)"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "$ "
          span class="text-blue-500"
            "curl"
          " -X POST https://darash.tsc.hk/api/research \\"
        div class="whitespace-pre"
          "    -H \"authorization: Bearer dk_…\" -d '@LB@\"query\": \"rust async\", \"limit\": 3@RB@'"
    h3 class="mt-6.5 mb-2 text-[15px] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "#"
      " keys & limits"
    div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr))] gap-2"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "anonymous"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "No key needed: search + fetch at 30 requests/hour, 100/day per IP. That is the only limit an IP ever hits."
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "free key"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Unmetered search + fetch, plus batch (cap 20) and background async jobs. Ask for one — keys pass as Authorization: Bearer dk_…"
      div class="border border-zinc-800 rounded-md px-3 py-[9px] bg-zinc-900 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(9.5rem,max-content)_1fr] gap-y-[3px] gap-x-3.5 items-baseline"
        div class="text-blue-500 text-[12.5px]"
          "pro key"
        div class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px]"
          "Everything free has, a batch cap of 45, and /api/research: a search that fetches the top pages and returns a per-source markdown corpus."
    p class="text-zinc-400 text-[12.5px] max-w-[58rem]"
      "Keys are never rate-limited — only anonymous traffic is. Check GET /api/account for your usage snapshot. Rate-limit responses carry Retry-After."

  section class="py-[34px] md:py-11" id="live"
    h2 class="m-0 mb-2.5 text-[21px] tracking-[-0.01em] text-zinc-100"
      span class="text-blue-500"
        "$"
      " live"
    p class="m-0 mb-3.5 text-zinc-400 max-w-[58rem]"
      "Streaming GET /api/live over a websocket (polling GET /api/stats as fallback) — obfuscated client ids, real request shapes, from the hosted instance or any self-host mirror."
    div data-island="live"
      p class="text-zinc-400"
        "connecting…"

